    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1.2
  m_Text: "\uACF5\uACA9 \xB7 \uBD88\uAF43 \uAC80\r\nSword_Fire01.wav \u2014 SonoFxAudio\r\n\xA9
    SonoFxAudio. Copyright protected.\r\nCC-BY-4.0\r\nhttps://freesound.org/people/SonoFxAudio/sounds/649361/\r\nhttps://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\r\n\uD3B8\uC9D1:
    \uC0AC\uC6A9 \uAD6C\uAC04 \uC120\uD0DD, EQ\xB7\uC74C\uB7C9\xB7\uD398\uC774\uB4DC
    \uC870\uC815, WAV \uBCC0\uD658.\r\n\r\n\uC77C\uBC18 \uD68C\uD53C \xB7 \uC9E7\uC740
    \uBC14\uB78C\r\nSwosh / Whoosh / Air Cut \u2014 qubodup\r\nCC0-1.0\r\nhttps://freesound.org/people/qubodup/sounds/60030/\r\nhttps://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/\r\n\uD3B8\uC9D1:
    \uC0AC\uC6A9 \uAD6C\uAC04 \uC120\uD0DD, EQ\xB7\uC74C\uB7C9\xB7\uD398\uC774\uB4DC
    \uC870\uC815, WAV \uBCC0\uD658.\r\n\r\n\uD53C\uACA9 \xB7 \uBAB8 \uCDA9\uACA9\r\nImpact:
    Smack Body \u2014 Philipp Grzemba / Sheyvan\r\nCC0-1.0\r\nhttps://freesound.org/people/Sheyvan/sounds/540752/\r\nhttps://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/\r\n\uD3B8\uC9D1:
    \uC0AC\uC6A9 \uAD6C\uAC04 \uC120\uD0DD, EQ\xB7\uC74C\uB7C9\xB7\uD398\uC774\uB4DC
    \uC870\uC815, WAV \uBCC0\uD658.\r\n\r\n\uACF5\uACA9\uC74C \uC800\uC791\uAD8C:
    \xA9 SonoFxAudio.\r\nCC BY 4.0\uC5D0 \uB530\uB77C \uC0AC\uC6A9\uD558\uBA70, \uC6D0\uC791\uC790\uC758
    \uD6C4\uC6D0\uC744 \uC758\uBBF8\uD558\uC9C0 \uC54A\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uD574\uB2F9
    \uC74C\uC6D0\uACFC \uD3B8\uC9D1\uBCF8\uC5D0 \uCD94\uAC00 \uC81C\uD55C\uC744 \uBD80\uACFC\uD558\uC9C0
    \uC54A\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.\r\n\r\n\uAE30\uC874 \uC74C\uC545\xB7\uD6A8\uACFC\uC74C
    (CC0)\r\n\r\nDark Shrine Loop \u2014 qubodup and yd\r\nhttps://opengameart.org/content/dark-shrine-loop\r\n\r\nDark
    Theme \u2014 JaggedStone\r\nhttps://opengameart.org/content/dark-theme\r\n\r\nEpic
    Boss Battle \u2014 Juhani Junkala / SubspaceAudio\r\nhttps://opengameart.org/content/boss-battle-music\r\n\r\nDungeon
    Ambience \u2014 yd\r\nhttps://opengameart.org/content/dungeon-ambience\r\n\r\nBell
    1 O'clock \u2014 Joseph SARDIN & Axeline T.\r\nhttps://bigsoundbank.com/cloche-1h-s3446.html\r\n\r\nMedieval
    sound effects \u2014 Weapon impacts \u2014 Ben Jaszczak & Brian Nelson / Still
    North Media\r\nhttps://opengameart.org/content/medieval-sound-effects-weapon-impacts\r\n\r\nRPG
    Audio \u2014 Kenney\r\nhttps://kenney.nl/assets/rpg-audio\r\n\r\nImpact Sounds
    \u2014 Kenney\r\nhttps://kenney.nl/assets/impact-sounds\r\n\r\nCC0 1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/\r\n\uAE30\uC874
    \uC74C\uC6D0 \uD3B8\uC9D1: \uC74C\uB192\uC774\xB7EQ\xB7\uAD6C\uAC04\xB7\uC74C\uB7C9\xB7\uBC18\uBCF5
    \uC5F0\uACB0 \uC870\uC815.\r\n\uB4F1\uBD88 \uC810\uD654\uC74C: Last Bell \uC790\uCCB4
    \uD569\uC131.\r\n\n\nNeoDunggeunmo Pro \xB7 Eunbin Jeong (Dalgona.)\nSIL Open
